# Restart `npm run dev` after changes.
#
# DEV (`npm run dev`):
#   Leave VITE unset or comment out. The app calls same-origin `/api/*` and `vite.config.ts`
#   proxies to `http://127.0.0.1:8000` — no CORS issues (localhost vs 127.0.0.1 in the browser bar).
#   Override proxy target (optional):  VITE_DEV_API_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:9000  (vite.config only — set before `npm run dev`)
#
# Production / vite preview (`npm run build`, `vite preview`):
#   REQUIRED full URL:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.example.com

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
